Restructured the guard into a single branch with a `__builtin_expect` hint so the common in-range case falls through as straight-line code and the two error paths share one cold return, reducing branch/code-layout overhead on the hot decode path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
```